  message: "REVISED 2026-04-25 after empirical verification. Original framing was incorrect: cross-file 'from X import BAR' for variables already works via _extract_import_edges + _lookup_symbol_by_module (no kind filter). The 1,171 orphan variables on hypergumbo self-analysis are constants used only WITHIN their own module via bare-name reads inside function bodies — verified on ANDROID_MANIFEST (xml_config.py:58→474), APEX_BUILTINS (apex.py:55→658,695), PASS_ID (intra-file class methods). Real fix is intra-file ast.Name read resolution (Deliverable B, ~half day), not import-side changes. Description rewritten with the corrected analysis, two distinct deliverables identified with sequencing recommendation, deferred pending human prioritization."  # 10f4
