  message: "ADR-0023 (fully landed) settles Deliverable A in the negative: 'imports' is a syntactic fact, and dst.kind == 'variable' is queryable on the endpoint — no new 'references'-from-import edge type is justified. Per Phase 4b closure, the strict-mode drift linter would reject the change in pre-commit anyway. Deliverable B (intra-file ast.Name reads emitting 'references' edges to module-level variable Symbols) is unaffected and remains the substantive work in this item; its acceptance criteria are unchanged. Recommend scoping this item to Deliverable B only when it's picked up."  # 4ad7
